{"c":[{"id":"c0ea8e35a1decea4","sum":"Measured 2026-10-21: inside uv run --with duckdb==2.0.0, a nested uv run --no-sync --with duckdb==VERSION selects VERSION even with VIRTUAL_ENV inherited. DuckDB 2.0.0 EXPLAIN of unscoped cosine shows 'HNSW Index: embeddings_vector_hnsw' (title 'Hnsw Index Scan').","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261021T235230Z-23d8d4c0fc64a011","text":"From inside uv run --with duckdb==2.0.0, a nested uv run --no-sync --with duckdb==VERSION selects VERSION even when VIRTUAL_ENV is inherited (uv warns that VIRTUAL_ENV is ignored). Unsetting VIRTUAL_ENV is not what makes --with take effect. Measured 2026-10-21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T235230Z-b56004adfb0e92b0","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 EXPLAIN of the unscoped cosine query contains substring HNSW via the line 'HNSW Index: embeddings_vector_hnsw'; the operator title is 'Hnsw Index Scan', which does not itself contain HNSW. Case-sensitive 'HNSW' passes on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"14255a8dd58b8aa9","sum":"uv --with from a 2.0.0 overlay selects VERSION when the project env lacks it (VIRTUAL_ENV irrelevant); --project --with 1.5.4 reuses a 1.5.4 venv; a missing version exits 1. DuckDB 2.0.0 rejects the SQL lambda arrow (x -> ...); write lambda x: ..., which 1.5.4 accepts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T001048Z-3d45bd43ac82702b","text":"uv --with from a 2.0.0 overlay selects VERSION when the project env lacks it, VIRTUAL_ENV set or not. Unsetting VIRTUAL_ENV is not why. --project --with 1.5.4 reuses the project venv while it is 1.5.4. A missing version exits 1.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T010333Z-400a0f0e43cfc736","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 rejects the deprecated SQL lambda arrow (list_transform(l, x -> ...)) with BinderException; write lambda x: ... instead, which 1.5.4 also accepts. Engine SQL has no arrow lambdas (checked 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
